OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers continuing overnight,
OL,7,Fespecially in the west of the region.
OL,8,FThe breeze also gradually easing
OL,9,Fovernight, with the clearest skies
OL,10,Ftowards the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,13,Fplenty of sunshine, although a few
OL,14,Fshowers may continue throughout the
OL,15,Fmorning towards Devon and Cornwall.
OL,16,FTemperatures around average with light
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
